.bun/

# Generated connector output written into this checkout.
#
# `bun src/cli.ts <name>` defaults to ./packages/mcp-connectors/<name>/, and
# `bun src/cli.ts <name> --standalone` defaults to ./<name>/ — an arbitrary directory name
# that cannot be enumerated. So ignore every top-level directory and re-admit the ones this
# repo actually owns: an accidental `./slack/` stays untracked, and adding a genuine new
# top-level directory requires an explicit line here rather than happening by omission.
/*/
!/.github/
!/docs/
!/fixtures/
!/scripts/
!/src/
!/test/
